'''Sodom''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Lords of Destruction DRAGON EMPERORS (Gacha Event)|Lords of Destruction DRAGON EMPERORS]] and [[AIR BUSTERS (Gacha Event)|AIR BUSTERS]] events. It was added in [[Version 2.2 Update|Version 2.2]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 5.7 Update|Version 5.7]] improves health, range, movement speed and attack rate, as well as raising its chance to [[Knockback|knockback]] [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemies to 100%. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 8.0 Update|Version 8.0]], and Ultra Talents were added in [[Version 14.0 Update|Version 14.0]].

