==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 4.7 Update|Version 4.7]], Sodom was a part of two other [[Cat Combo]]s: [[Lords of Earth (Removed Combo)|Lords of Earth]] and [[Dragon Emperors (Removed Combo)|Dragon Emperors]].
*Sodom gained [[Immune to Knockback]] in [[Version 5.3 Update|Version 5.3]].
*[[wikipedia:Sodom and Gomorrah|Sodom]] is the name of an ancient city that was said to be destroyed by a rain of fire in the [[wikipedia:Book of Genesis|Book of Genesis]].
*As of [[Version 14.2 Update|Version 14.2]], Sodom with [[Ultra Talents]] is the first Uber Rare Cat to have 2 Slayer abilities at once. Those being [[Behemoth Slayer]] and [[Sage Slayer]].

